        <div style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); padding:14px 0;">
            <h3 style="font-size:1rem; margin-bottom:0.4rem;">How much does a commercial access control installation cost per door in Kansas City?</h3>
            <p style="color:var(--muted); font-size:0.9rem; line-height:1.7;">Most commercial door installations range between $1,200 and $2,500 per door depending on existing door hardware, frame material (such as aluminum storefront or hollow metal), low-voltage cable run distances, and whether magnetic locks or electric strikes are required.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); padding:14px 0;">
            <h3 style="font-size:1rem; margin-bottom:0.4rem;">Can our access control system integrate with existing commercial IP security cameras?</h3>
            <p style="color:var(--muted); font-size:0.9rem; line-height:1.7;">Yes. We specialize in low-voltage and commercial security integration, linking door access events directly with your commercial IP camera surveillance system so property managers receive instant video verification whenever a door is forced, propped open, or accessed after hours.</p>
