            <p style="color:var(--muted); font-size:0.9rem; line-height:1.7;">With our cloud-managed access control platforms, administrators can grant, modify, or revoke keycards and mobile credentials instantly from any web browser or mobile app, eliminating the need to rekey doors or manually visit the property.</p>
